{"parse": {"title": "小狗与流浪汉-08", "pageid": 89615, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%81%E6%B5%AA%E6%B1%89-07\" title=\"小狗与流浪汉-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">小狗与流浪汉-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">小狗与流浪汉</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.B5.A0.E4.BA.88.E4.BB.AA.E5.BC.8F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"赠予仪式\">赠予仪式</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 赠予仪式</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Transfer Ceremony</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺。<i>&lt;禁止进入。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺……狺狺。<i>&lt;还有气味……那应该就是这里。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺。<i>&lt;但愿那个泡泡先生还在。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-chuancangneibu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"chuancangneibu\"><img alt=\"chuancangneibu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Cg-chuancangneibu.png/600px-Cg-chuancangneibu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Cg-chuancangneibu.png/900px-Cg-chuancangneibu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Cg-chuancangneibu.png/1200px-Cg-chuancangneibu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>三明治……没吃到……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>吽吽，吽！<i>&lt;真不敢置信，他还有意识！&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪。<i>&lt;您的幸运应该离不开体质的帮助。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>吽，汪汪汪。<i>&lt;醒醒，肥皂泡先生。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗拽了拽他的发带。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>嗯……唔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪。<i>&lt;物理刺激效果欠佳。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪汪。<i>&lt;您看起来需要更为湿润的刺激。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜……<i>&lt;嗯……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪，呜。<i>&lt;但我不喜欢您身上的味道，它太复杂了。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>哦……唔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>是艺术的甘霖吗……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>可是这艺术闻起来怎么像口水……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>吽，汪汪汪。<i>&lt;太好了，您睁开眼睛了。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>挖掘艺术试图努力地将眼神聚焦在天花板上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我的头好痛……这是哪儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我在新世界的大门内了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪，汪汪汪。<i>&lt;我想并不是，您现在在操作间的大门内。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪……<i>&lt;剧烈的冲击可能已经对您的大脑造成了损害……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗很担心你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>嘿！是盟友！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>你也没事！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>啊哈！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>这证明新时代的先锋所带领的这次行动圆满成功！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪汪，汪汪。<i>&lt;您是一个如此乐观的人，这很好。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪呜。<i>&lt;这对您接下来的行动应该会有所帮助。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗想邀请你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>嗯？邀请我？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪。<i>&lt;显然主办方想为大家带来不一样的惊喜。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>吽吽。<i>&lt;看看我在走廊里发现的这个。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/HeadIconSmall-306401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>哦……一场……关于你的派对？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>嘿！这根本不公平！作为启蒙者的我从来没有受邀参加过演讲！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>人们宁可听猎犬的吠叫吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜呜。<i>&lt;我放弃纠正您的生物认知了。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪，汪，汪呜。<i>&lt;但是先生，如果您喜欢的话，我想以您的能力足以使让现场热闹起来。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪汪，汪呜。<i>&lt;那样他们便可以自娱自乐，不会将期待的目光投向我了。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗想将派对交给你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪，汪。<i>&lt;感谢你在这时候可以正常运转，Doggie。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>哦？！真的吗？！我的天！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-306410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我梦寐以求的个人演讲会……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>该死，这太完美了！感谢你的慷慨，我的盟友！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>哦，不过……但愿我的镜面肥皂水还够用……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>吽吽。<i>&lt;这应该不用担心。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗的眼中闪动着靛蓝色的光芒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>吽，吽吽。<i>&lt;上午的经验告诉我，我应该能帮上您的忙。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗跃跃欲试。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>哦，你怎么这么兴奋？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>好的～好的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>让我们动起来吧，盟友！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"youlunjiaban_ye\"><img alt=\"youlunjiaban_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png/600px-Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png/900px-Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png/1200px-Cg-youlunjiaban_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>好伙计，温迪！快捡过来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪，汪汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>现在这儿是属于我们的，大家都去吃晚餐啦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小斗牛犬一屁股坐在了查尔顿的旁边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小斗牛犬兴趣缺缺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>嗯？你是饿了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>再等等，小皮克勒斯应该很快就会回来的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>轻巧的脚步声自查尔顿的身后逐渐靠近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>哦——皮克勒斯！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>我就知道这次你会回来的，聪明的小家伙！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人的手驾轻就熟地探入厚厚的绒毛里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪，汪，呜呜？<i>&lt;喔，这真舒服。可以再摸一下下巴那儿吗？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>工作人员都去找你了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>但不要担心。要是你想躲到演出结束，我一定会努力帮你的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪汪，汪呜。<i>&lt;我想这方面你不用担心了，刚刚我恰巧与他们擦肩而过。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪……嗯……汪汪汪。<i>&lt;他们现在应该也沉浸在……呃……“新艺术美梦派对”中。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪，汪汪汪。<i>&lt;似乎不是这个名字，但这是小问题。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>嗯，汪汪汪。<i>&lt;以我的经验，我想直到演出时间结束时他们都会很忙碌的。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>唉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>我很抱歉没能成功……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夜晚的海风扑面而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>哈哈，想要摸透你的心思并不容易，我从没见过你这样如此与众不同的好伙伴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>你真的只喜欢那些我读不明白的书本吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜。<i>&lt;我无法保证自己喜好的流动。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪汪。<i>&lt;或许有一天我也会爱上海鲈鱼配方罐头与抛接球。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪，汪——汪汪汪。<i>&lt;但目前除了那些书本，我也不讨厌你的苹果派——尽管它偶尔会有些偏酸。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪呜……<i>&lt;包括这次旅行……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>嗯……<i>&lt;和你在这儿坐着，吹吹海风……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪呜。<i>&lt;我想现在的舒适度仅次于我第二遍阅读《理想国》的时候。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗想陪你坐着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>嗯，这个翻译器有专业的维修商店吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>但既然你想坐着，那我们就一起坐着！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>温迪的小脑袋也挤进了查尔顿的臂弯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>知道了，小家伙！待会儿我们就下去拿几个三明治！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>但是现在——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>月光洒向海面，泛起了柔和的粼光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>让我们就这么坐着，好好地享受这个夜晚吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>自船身内传来了模糊而喧闹的乐声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——看来所有人都获得了最好的夜晚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "小狗与流浪汉-08"}}